744	\subsection{Conditional Instructions}\label{sec:isa-cond}
745	%% {{{
746	Most, although not quite all, instructions may be conditionally executed.  
747	The 23--bit load immediate instruction, together with the special instructions,
748	{\tt NOOP}, {\tt SIM}, {\tt BREAK}, and {\tt LOCK}, are the exceptions to this
749	rule.  All other instructions may be conditionally executed.

